Corpus 4 fixture: a subresource of an UNKNOWN asset type, referenced as a
stylesheet by error/index.html. It exists (so it is served, not 404) but its
.unknownext extension is not a known script/style type, so the preview scheme
serves it 200 while recording an `unsupported-asset-type` diagnostic (AC7/AC20).
